	"variations": [
		{
			"statement": "Voici les notes sur $10$ obtenues par les élèves d'une classe à un contrôle.\n\n```effectifs\ntitre: Note\n4 = {{n0}}\n5 = {{n1}}\n6 = {{n2}}\n7 = {{n3}}\n8 = {{n4}}\n9 = {{n5}}\nlignes: effectifs\n```\n\nQuelle est la médiane de cette série ?\n\n$?$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "n0",
					"expression": "1..9"
				},
				{
					"name": "n1",
					"expression": "1..9"
				},
				{
					"name": "n2",
					"expression": "1..9"
				},
				{
					"name": "n3",
					"expression": "1..9"
				},
				{
					"name": "n4",
					"expression": "1..9"
				},
				{
					"name": "n5",
					"expression": "1..9"
				},
				{
					"name": "C0",
					"expression": "eval:n0"
				},
				{
					"name": "C1",
					"expression": "eval:n0+n1"
				},
				{
					"name": "C2",
					"expression": "eval:n0+n1+n2"
				},
				{
					"name": "C3",
					"expression": "eval:n0+n1+n2+n3"
				},
